1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:04,216
In this world, you get one lie. Whatever
you say, everyone believes it forever.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,646
Everyone except you. Most

3
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:09,476
people waste it. My coworker Jake told
our boss he'd already finished the report.

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:13,676
He hadn't started. Now our boss quotes
numbers from a report that doesn't exist.

5
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:16,136
My aunt told her landlord
the rent was paid.

6
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:19,236
That was eleven years ago.
She still hasn't paid it.

7
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:22,676
My dad never used his.
Everyone said he was wasting it.

8
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:25,806
He wore the same coat for
nine winters, worked two jobs,

9
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:29,156
and every time I asked how he was,
he said the same thing.

10
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,276
I'm fine.

11
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:32,676
When I turned eighteen, I begged him.

12
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:33,876
Dad, use your lie.

13
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,996
Tell the world we're rich.
He just laughed. Not yet.

14
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:41,156
Then Mom got sick. He sat by her bed every
night. On the last night, he held her

15
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:45,206
hand and whispered something I couldn't
hear. She smiled. Then she fell asleep.

16
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:47,986
Years later, I found his
old phone in a drawer.

17
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:52,096
There was one voice note. I used my
lie tonight. I told her I'd be okay.

18
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,427
She believed it.

19
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:55,086
Everyone believes me.

20
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:56,676
Everyone except me.

21
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:59,636
He has said I'm fine
every day for twenty years.

22
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,916
And I believed him.

23
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,126
Everyone did.

24
00:01:02,210 --> 00:01:04,131
Nobody checked on him once.

25
00:01:04,595 --> 00:01:06,191
I'm calling him right now.

26
00:01:06,275 --> 00:01:08,806
If you got one lie,
who would you tell it to?

